amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/6b5e28ef15ada06d5049d54e16d52ad3f8f2493a/ss_6b5e28ef15ada06d5049d54e16d52ad3f8f2493a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757488875","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170560/6b5e28ef15ada06d5049d54e16d52ad3f8f2493a/ss_6b5e28ef15ada06d5049d54e16d52ad3f8f2493a.600x338.jpg?t=1757488875"}],"short_description":"Design and build your defenses against various enemies on countless skyislands in this city-building, siege and exploration tower defense game. Unleash magic in the city to direct the battle and hold the island heart of the kingdom.","steam_appid":3170560,"support_info":{"email":"ghostxcnet@163.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}